00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.290
Send out a pursuit team.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:19.160
Look at his speed.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:13.470
Let's rest for a while.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.880
I seem to recall...

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:52.480
I looked upon a darkness
like this long, long ago.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.590
This is the path of the kai.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:06:01.390
Few should know of the existence
of this path anymore.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.790
What is it?

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:14.170
Why do you know of this path?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.870
Like phosphorescent puffs of smoke
words pass by from time to time,

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:27.160
and I realize that those are
words spoken by you.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:29.950
Why? How could it be?

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:33.920
Why don't I react to this
feeling with surprise?

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:39.630
This path continues, doesn't it?

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:44.060
Let's go.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:13.900
Damn!

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.640
We've tracked him to section D-32,

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:17.870
but we can't go any farther.

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:32.750
