00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:38.160
Yes, though I did allow my
judgement to take priority.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.500
Colonel, you are aware that we,
the experimental company,

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.070
are not under the direct command
of the Staff Officers' Office?

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:48.600
And we are not happy about the fact
that other TA pilots and crew

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.000
were being trained without
our knowledge.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.810
But it's been over an hour since
this incident began.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:59.810
Isn't it already beyond the maximum
operational duration of the TA?

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:01.780
The TA that's running amok

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:05.080
