capacity fuel cell batteries.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.190
Improved version?

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:11.020
Yes, it is capable of operating for
a maximum of thirty-six hours.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:14.160
Thirty-six hours?!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:17.870
That's crazy! Piloting a TA
for more than an hour?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.570
It ignores the physical limitations
of the pilot's body.

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:24.900
Yes, if it continues any longer,
the pilot's life is threatened.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:37.340
Colonel Hirokawa, I just have
one question to ask you.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:42.990
You mentioned before that
this was an accident...

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:45.660
That's just what I mean.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:50.290
We are not certain what
triggered the incident.

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:53.130
